{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "894b09d71615d15eae07e93865f5e35c7ef15abd2f3d89c4cf50b32978087ca6", "ja": "（未来のコスプレグラビア企画の撮影日。\nヒョウのように躍動感のある姿を撮ることになった）", "zh": "（未来的Cosplay写真企划拍摄日。今天要拍摄她像豹子一样充满动感的身姿。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "1029e7a5293e61dd99a0e3a2064e537ab6a171a477554f0f9f69b6ff6687589c", "ja": "お待たせしました～。ヒョウの衣装……\nカッコよくて大人っぽくて、私、好きです♪", "zh": "让你们久等了～这套猎豹服装……\n既帅气又成熟，我很喜欢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5e3bcce9e676e10f7a13055eff4c4969673776b942d4bb07c645842711af86ee", "ja": "ははっ、喜んでくれてよかった。\nとっても可愛いぞ、未来！", "zh": "哈哈，你喜欢就好。\n非常可爱哦，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "c047e87e02bacf34c288c38336ccd62918ba9f9de97750b3d43b8ca787edfb71", "ja": "本当ですか！　えへへ♪\n今なら、ずーっと遠くまでダッシュできそうです！", "zh": "真的吗！　嘿嘿♪\n现在的话，感觉能一直冲刺到很远的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2b6b38885296badee11cc24357200db3b4eb040f864f4d9054e41d9ac69cdba8", "ja": "おお、頼もしいな。今日はヒョウっぽく、走ったり\n跳んだりもするそうだから、体力は温存しとかないと。", "zh": "哦，真可靠啊。听说今天要像豹子一样奔跑、跳跃，所以得保存好体力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "aef4f13bebdf4cf6ef53c4a03e7f750ffe601a6659c33c631f7c705d192d0446", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ！　私、運動するの好きですし。\nアイドルになってからは、毎日レッスンしてますから♪", "zh": "没问题的！我本来就很喜欢运动。\n而且成为偶像之后，每天也都在上课练习呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "bc19209c90004b8e7e594132f17b5fee1ba76e7e2743d5e000dddbae4a7e88cd", "ja": "前より、体力がついたと思うんですよね～。\nだから自信があります！", "zh": "我觉得自己的体力比以前更好了呢～所以很有信心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8f6fc74af376f02a6e21f7539e2279fc66b2cc926566601fe7d7f7e2f9ef818e", "ja": "そうか、未来が大丈夫ならいいんだ。\nでも油断はしないように。", "zh": "这样啊，未来没问题就好。不过也不能掉以轻心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "f7b9411d2b7dc188c1e6a0aa1886e664697e66c07eb1c19423767a1933c572e3", "ja": "はーい！　あ、{$P$}さん！\nこの後、ちょっと走ってきてもいいですか？", "zh": "好——！啊，{$P$}先生！接下来，我可以去跑一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "acaffc4aff1cefc03910380f9b8b0b22a13f3cddf53e53bfbdf64614f221294d", "ja": "私、アイドルになる前って、\nいろんな部活に入ってたじゃないですか。", "zh": "我在成为偶像之前，\n加入过好多社团，您也知道的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "b2075f8b0be01da2cb031ef005460cf5ba1832872a89082412c3278ce55faa7c", "ja": "その時運動部のみんなが「ウォーミングアップは大事」\nって言ってたの、ちょっと思い出したんです。", "zh": "我刚才想起，那个时候运动社团的大家都说过：“热身很重要。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1011_p", "source_sha256": "71ed79cf8e907ca245c063f0685d7f247c40489ebbbf561ebf3f31daa4b88b1f", "ja": "確かに、本番前に少し慣らした方がいいかもな。\nわかった、遠くまで行かないように気をつけて！", "zh": "确实，正式开始前稍微活动一下可能比较好。\n好，注意别跑太远了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "e1ff89a365bbe66dc8ee53c7496a225ceae0ed57008d63daf8520835657ed360", "ja": "わかりました～。……あっ、そうだ！\n{$P$}さんも、走りませんか？", "zh": "明白啦～……啊，对了！\n{$P$}先生也要不要一起跑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1013_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "be10852fd9e4782d0c4588a9f353c3bfc2e03aa325b5ef78bd02c2f4d1b8b145", "ja": "天気もいいし、走ると気持ちいいと思うんです！\nこの前「運動する時間がない」って言ってましたよね？", "zh": "天气这么好，去跑步肯定很舒服的！\n您之前不是说过“没有时间运动”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1015_p", "source_sha256": "11f1dc4fbaaaf07a39539fdb48a269fc7aac5704940de122461ad42d44ce904b", "ja": "そ、そんな事言った気もするけど、\n何も今じゃなくても……。", "zh": "好、好像是说过这种话，可也不用非得现在吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "664caf47c017965e6e5ae1ae96c843b658537c47afb7945e27685885eb955066", "ja": "ダメですよー。何とかは急げって言うじゃないですか！\nそれじゃ、行きましょう！　位置について～……。", "zh": "不行啦。不是都说了要事不宜迟吗！\n那么，我们走吧！各就各位～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d9ca93cb4664e5b6de556a6bdf6c368715c622d19a7f39ea5f0f440f459fd028", "ja": "未来！　それは善は急げ……っていうか意味も違うぞ！\n待った待った！　まだ準備が……！", "zh": "未来！那是“善行要及时”……不对，意思也完全不一样啊！\n等等等等！还没准备好呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0593_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "d282eaca8e57efb1f31b7949395d3e415d5f29a374bf48e5f616e205fb0de7f6", "ja": "先に、向こうの大きな木に着いた方が勝ちですよ～。\nえへへ♪　よーい……ドーン！！", "zh": "先到那边那棵大树的人获胜哦～。\n嘿嘿♪　预备……跑！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
